## 3. Add Song to Playlist

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Playlist Builder</title>
</head>
<body>

<input type="text" placeholder="Enter song name">
<button>Add Song</button>

<ul id="playlist"></ul>

<script>

